	"Description": "Pin-aware auto-layout for Blueprint graphs. Handles branches, pure nodes, multi-event roots, reroute (knot) nodes, and comment boxes — and can optionally wrap each event/function subtree in an auto-named comment. Right-click empty graph space → Auto Layout Graph.",
